PYANNOTE DIARIZATION MODELS — NOTICE AND ATTRIBUTION
=====================================================

This Docker image contains model weights downloaded from HuggingFace at
image build time:

  pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1
      Pipeline configuration (config.yaml), MIT licence.
      https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1

  pyannote/segmentation-3.0
      Speaker segmentation model weights.
      https://huggingface.co/pyannote/segmentation-3.0

  pyannote/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM
      Speaker embedding model weights.
      https://huggingface.co/pyannote/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM

The pyannote.audio library and the pyannote model weights are released under
the MIT License (https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT).

